       [1mset-url[0m
           Change URLs for the remote. Sets first URL for remote [4m<name>[24m that matches regex [4m<oldurl>[24m (first URL if no
           [4m<oldurl>[24m is given) to [4m<newurl>[24m. If [4m<oldurl>[24m doesn’t match any URL, an error occurs and nothing is changed.

           With [1m--push[22m, push URLs are manipulated instead of fetch URLs.

